      "prov:value": "<cat-harness.processes:fulfilment kinds=\"person\" reason=\"A sign-off on a requirements document is the requester's decision about their own requirements (issue #2405 FR-011): `approved` and `accepted` need a HUMAN sign-off, which `check:requirements` refuses without, so an agent may not take this step on their behalf.",
